1
00:00:02,072 --> 00:00:03,502
Season two picks up right

2
00:00:03,522 --> 00:00:04,877
where we left off.

3
00:00:04,897 --> 00:00:07,577
The protomolecule has taken over Eros,

4
00:00:07,597 --> 00:00:10,002
the Rocinante crew is on the run,

5
00:00:10,022 --> 00:00:11,127
and Earth and Mars

6
00:00:11,147 --> 00:00:13,077
are edging toward war.

7
00:00:13,097 --> 00:00:15,302
On Earth, Avasarala is playing

8
00:00:15,322 --> 00:00:17,372
a dangerous political game.

9
00:00:17,452 --> 00:00:19,247
On Ganymede, the breadbasket

10
00:00:19,267 --> 00:00:20,522
of the outer planets,

11
00:00:20,542 --> 00:00:22,672
trouble is quietly growing.

12
00:00:22,692 --> 00:00:23,947
Three stories again,

13
00:00:23,967 --> 00:00:24,687
and this time,

14
00:00:24,707 --> 00:00:27,062
the alien thing is on the move.

15
00:00:27,082 --> 00:00:28,362
Spoilers ahead!

16
00:00:29,101 --> 00:00:31,556
Story one: Miller and the crew.

17
00:00:31,576 --> 00:00:34,281
Holden's team and Miller raid Thoth Station,

18
00:00:34,301 --> 00:00:36,331
the secret Protogen lab behind

19
00:00:36,351 --> 00:00:37,956
the Eros experiment.

20
00:00:37,976 --> 00:00:38,856
They win the fight,

21
00:00:38,876 --> 00:00:40,651
but the scientist in charge,

22
00:00:40,671 --> 00:00:45,551
Dresden, insists the protomolecule could turn humans into gods.

23
00:00:45,571 --> 00:00:47,351
Holden wants a trial.

24
00:00:47,371 --> 00:00:49,951
Miller decides that argument is over.

25
00:00:49,971 --> 00:00:52,141
The crew is learning to work together,

26
00:00:52,161 --> 00:00:53,516
but they don't always agree

27
00:00:53,536 --> 00:00:55,229
on what justice looks like.

28
00:00:55,829 --> 00:00:57,339
Then Eros starts moving,

29
00:00:57,359 --> 00:00:58,614
all by itself,

30
00:00:58,634 --> 00:01:00,289
straight toward Earth.

31
00:01:00,309 --> 00:01:02,009
Earth fires nuclear missiles,

32
00:01:02,029 --> 00:01:04,814
but Eros goes stealthy and slips away,

33
00:01:04,834 --> 00:01:07,164
so the Rocinante paints it with lasers

34
00:01:07,184 --> 00:01:08,689
to guide them in.

35
00:01:08,709 --> 00:01:10,239
Miller rides into the station

36
00:01:10,259 --> 00:01:12,839
with a nuclear bomb and finds Julie,

37
00:01:12,859 --> 00:01:15,764
still alive inside the protomolecule.

38
00:01:15,784 --> 00:01:17,889
He talks her out of hitting Earth.

39
00:01:17,909 --> 00:01:20,139
Eros crashes into Venus instead,

40
00:01:20,159 --> 00:01:21,512
with Miller beside her.

41
00:01:22,241 --> 00:01:24,026
Story two: Bobbie.

42
00:01:24,046 --> 00:01:26,271
Bobbie Draper is a Martian Marine,

43
00:01:26,291 --> 00:01:27,321
tough and proud,

44
00:01:27,341 --> 00:01:29,821
guarding Ganymede, the moon that grows food

45
00:01:29,841 --> 00:01:31,541
for the outer planets.

46
00:01:31,641 --> 00:01:32,596
In her battle armor,

47
00:01:32,616 --> 00:01:34,796
she's basically a walking tank.

48
00:01:34,816 --> 00:01:37,266
One night, something attacks her squad.

49
00:01:37,286 --> 00:01:38,516
It isn't human.

50
00:01:38,536 --> 00:01:40,666
The fight sparks a battle between Earth

51
00:01:40,686 --> 00:01:42,741
and Mars above the moon.

52
00:01:42,761 --> 00:01:44,641
Bobbie is the only survivor,

53
00:01:44,661 --> 00:01:46,066
and her own side doesn't want

54
00:01:46,086 --> 00:01:47,392
to hear what she saw.

55
00:01:48,073 --> 00:01:49,253
Bobbie is sent to Earth

56
00:01:49,273 --> 00:01:50,503
for peace talks,

57
00:01:50,523 --> 00:01:53,478
where Avasarala sees what Mars won't.

58
00:01:53,498 --> 00:01:54,528
The blunt Marine

59
00:01:54,548 --> 00:01:56,478
and the sharp-tongued politician become

60
00:01:56,498 --> 00:01:58,453
an unlikely team.

61
00:01:58,473 --> 00:02:00,228
Bobbie defects to help expose

62
00:02:00,248 --> 00:02:02,228
the people behind the monster.

63
00:02:02,248 --> 00:02:03,253
Their chase ends

64
00:02:03,273 --> 00:02:05,778
on Jules-Pierre Mao's own yacht,

65
00:02:05,798 --> 00:02:08,268
where Bobbie, in full battle armor,

66
00:02:08,288 --> 00:02:09,693
arrives just in time

67
00:02:09,713 --> 00:02:11,845
to save Avasarala's life.

68
00:02:12,574 --> 00:02:14,704
Story three: Prax.

69
00:02:14,724 --> 00:02:17,304
Praxidike Meng is a botanist on Ganymede

70
00:02:17,324 --> 00:02:20,424
whose daughter Mei vanished just before the attack.

71
00:02:20,534 --> 00:02:23,414
As the moon's mirrors and greenhouses fail,

72
00:02:23,434 --> 00:02:26,639
refugees pack onto any ship they can find.

73
00:02:26,659 --> 00:02:29,514
Prax refuses to leave without his daughter.

74
00:02:29,534 --> 00:02:31,664
The Rocinante crew helps him search

75
00:02:31,684 --> 00:02:32,974
the wrecked station,

76
00:02:32,994 --> 00:02:34,224
and they find signs

77
00:02:34,244 --> 00:02:36,615
of a hidden protomolecule lab.

78
00:02:37,346 --> 00:02:39,651
Then they discover a hybrid creature hiding

79
00:02:39,671 --> 00:02:40,826
on their own ship,

80
00:02:40,846 --> 00:02:44,866
fast, strong, and almost impossible to kill.

81
00:02:44,886 --> 00:02:47,101
Prax comes up with a clever plan,

82
00:02:47,121 --> 00:02:47,901
and they lure it out

83
00:02:47,921 --> 00:02:50,851
and burn it with the Rocinante's drive.

84
00:02:50,871 --> 00:02:54,001
Meanwhile, Naomi admits she secretly gave

85
00:02:54,021 --> 00:02:57,041
a protomolecule sample to Fred Johnson,

86
00:02:57,061 --> 00:02:59,141
so the Belt would have it too.

87
00:02:59,161 --> 00:03:00,735
The crew splits over it.

88
00:03:01,437 --> 00:03:04,272
Season two ends with Mei still missing,

89
00:03:04,292 --> 00:03:05,777
a secret lab on Io,

90
00:03:05,797 --> 00:03:08,012
and something strange stirring on Venus,

91
00:03:08,032 --> 00:03:09,837
where Eros crashed.

92
00:03:09,857 --> 00:03:11,837
Holden and Naomi aren't speaking,

93
00:03:11,857 --> 00:03:14,812
and Bobbie has a new boss in Avasarala.

94
00:03:14,832 --> 00:03:16,042
The war is close,

95
00:03:16,062 --> 00:03:18,592
and the protomolecule is waking up.

96
00:03:18,612 --> 00:03:20,676
Next up: season three.

